NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE

This repository contains ONLY installer/orchestration code. It does not bundle,
vendor, or redistribute any VPN panel.

The panels it installs are separate projects with their own licenses, and they
are fetched at install time directly from their upstream sources:

  - 3x-ui      (MHSanaei/3x-ui)        — GPL-3.0
  - Marzban    (Gozargah/Marzban)      — AGPL-3.0
  - Remnawave  (remnawave/backend)     — AGPL-3.0

Respect the license of whichever panel you deploy. If you fork this installer
and change it, that is your code — but the panels remain their authors' work.
